  "content": "<h2><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1233/258/banner-better-pvp-png.png\"></h2><h2>&nbsp;</h2><h2><strong>⚠注意事項</strong>：自2026年1月8日起，Heycronus團隊的所有專案將僅透過CurseForge、Modrinth和Planet Minecraft上的devHeycronus帳號正式發布與維護。</h2><h2>&nbsp;</h2><h2>更佳PVP - 材質包</h2><p><strong>以更清晰的視覺、精準度與風格，將你的PVP提升至全新層次！</strong><br><em>更佳PVP</em>是一款專為改善遊戲體驗而設計的材質包，讓你的介面在戰鬥中更簡潔、美觀且高效。</p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.paypal.com%252fdonate%252f%253fbusiness%253dLAEZJ6TS7CYP6%2526no_recurring%253d0%2526item_name%253dHelp%2bme%2bcontinue%2bwith%2bthe%2bprojects%2bwith%2ba%2bsimple%2bdonation%2b-%2bHeycronus%2526currency_code%253dUSD\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"font-weight:400;display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1013293/description_41c410a1-3705-48e1-9d6d-faca354f3234.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"248\" height=\"93\"></a></p><h3>主要特色：</h3><p>&nbsp;</p><p>-🎯 <strong>自訂準心：</strong>更簡潔的設計，提升瞄準精準度。</p><p>-🔢 <strong>附編號快捷欄：</strong>讓物品切換更快更順手。🌈 <strong>RGB經驗條：</strong>為你的介面增添現代繽紛色彩。</p><p>-⚔️ <strong>縮小劍模型：</strong>減少畫面遮擋，戰鬥視野更開闊。</p><p>-🎃 <strong>南瓜頭清晰視野：</strong>移除戴上雕刻南瓜時的視覺障礙。</p><p>-🧱 <strong>改良的方塊破壞進度條：</strong>方塊破壞進度顯示得更清楚。</p><p>專為追求更佳效能、敏捷操作與更美觀介面的PVP玩家打造。</p><p><strong>立即下載，升級你的遊戲體驗！</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1291/574/sem-tatulo-2-png.png\"></strong></p>",
